# SPIDER's look (C, 2026-11-18): every main page, a knob turned (its cell the track's ink), a help card over the tag,
# a list with its hints; the layout audit fails on any label cut, clipped or overlapping in Terminus and Handjet
wait 300
tappad 0
tappad 4
tappad 9
tappad 12
tap PLAY
wait 260
shot a_steps.png
turn ALGO 1
wait 100
shot b_steps_mono.png
tap EDIT
wait 100
shot c_engine.png
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
shot d_play.png
tap ENV
wait 100
turn K2 5
wait 60
shot e_env.png
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
shot f_filter.png
tap FX
wait 100
shot g_character.png
tap GLO
wait 100
shot h_mix.png
tap HOME
wait 100
shot i_arrange.png
tap ARP
wait 100
shot j_players.png
press SEQ
wait 1300
shot k_card.png
release SEQ
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 100
shot l_list.png
tap HOME
wait 100
tap PLAY
wait 100
shot m_stopped.png
press SEQ
wait 1300
shot n_card_seq.png
release SEQ
wait 100
tap GLO
turn SELECT 6
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 100
shot o_setup.png
